# PlanningWorkspace - Repo Registry

**User-owned.** The plugin never overwrites this file (`/workspace-init refresh` leaves it untouched). It starts empty and grows organically: when work touches a repo not listed here, the agent obtains the clone URL (from the ticket, the user, or an existing clone's `git remote get-url origin`) and appends a row before proceeding.

